["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"ess","stream_identity":"01a0cabe-67c1-7103-8e43-bb0ee2ca8073","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIG0f1c5fa6e8076cced1d91b30823605163564871627853e22e6ddfbaf6446be1e","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/component-release-check-toolchains","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":6,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"## Outcome\n\nThe reusable ESS component release action provisions an exact component-selected Rust toolchain and optional Node/pnpm toolchains before running the repository-owned check command.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Rust toolchain selection is an explicit reusable-action input with the existing baseline as its default.\n- Node and pnpm setup is opt-in and version-pinned for components whose checks include generated browser surfaces.\n- Components that do not need Node retain the current release path and cost.\n- The action remains registry-, service-, and Service SDK-neutral.\n- Repository checks cover the new action inputs and conditional setup.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `.github/actions/release-component/action.yml`\n- `Taskfile.yml`\n- `CHANGELOG.md`\n","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:oci-component-delivery"}],"scope":[{"confidence":"cited","path":".github/actions/release-component/action.yml"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"CHANGELOG.md"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"Cargo.lock"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"Cargo.toml"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"Taskfile.yml"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"Let an ESS component release select its Rust, Node, and pnpm check toolchains without forking the OCI release pipeline.","title":"Provision component-owned release check toolchains"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"}},"id":"MIG0f1c5fa6e8076cced1d91b30823605163564871627853e22e6ddfbaf6446be1e","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":6,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIG0f1c5fa6e8076cced1d91b30823605163564871627853e22e6ddfbaf6446be1e"]}]